.DS_Store
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Everything generated lives in two directories, so "what is source" is a
# property of the layout rather than a list that has to be maintained.
#
#   data/  index.db, dictionaries.json, config.json, dicts/, .venv/
#          Rebuilt by setup.sh. The dictionary zips are licensed content, none
#          of it ours to redistribute: tools/fetch-dicts.py downloads the
#          freely licensed set, and commercial monolinguals are the user's own
#          to supply. config.json is per-machine state (target window,
#          dictionary order, trigger) created on first launch;
#          app/main/config.js holds the defaults.
#   bin/   Compiled helpers. Rebuild with ocr/build.sh.
data/
bin/

node_modules/
app/node_modules/
test/node_modules/

# Golden-master recordings (regenerate: test/golden.sh record baseline)
test/golden/

# Ground-truth corpora. ~200 MB of rendered pages, regenerable from the
# generators below, and the epub/kakuyomu sets are copyrighted source text.
test/gt/*
!test/gt/README.md
!test/gt/gen_aozora.py
!test/gt/gen_epub.py
